                    "type": "text",
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Soundfonts are freely available sound\nlibraries imported to musica11y.net.\n\nChose your sound for your instrument \nfrom the Soundfont panel. The current\nSoundfont will be listed there.\n\nYou can add different Soundfonts to\ndifferent layers of your instrument\n\n\n\n\n\nCreate an instrument on your tablet\nor computer, save it, and play it later\nin VR. You need to set up an account\nto save and play later.\n\nShare your saved instruments with\nfriends and musical collaborators.\n",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "verticalAlignment": "top"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "scaling": [
